# The parsed JSON value (RFC 8259). Real, compiling Term. Case names are prefixed `json-*` on purpose: `@term/host`'s
# own `data` form already owns the unprefixed `hash`/`array`/`flag`/`blank` case names as global constructors
# (deck/host/code/base.tree), and top-level case names are package-global (deck/term/CLAUDE.md's naming rule) —
# reusing them here would collide.

form json-value
  case json-object
    link entries
      like list
        like json-entry
  case json-array
    link items
      like list
        like json-value
  case json-string
    link value, like text
  case json-number
    link value, like decimal
  case json-flag
    link value, like boolean
  case json-blank

form json-entry
  link key, like text
  link value, like json-value
